# Local build artifacts that must never be uploaded to EAS Build: they can
# contain this machine's absolute filesystem paths baked in by Gradle/CMake
# (e.g. android/build/generated/autolinking/autolinking.json), which breaks
# the build on EAS's Linux builders if reused instead of being regenerated
# fresh there. Belt-and-suspenders on top of the nested .gitignore rules.
android/build/
android/app/build/
android/app/.cxx/
android/.gradle/
ios/build/
